           •   status of [1msapconf.service [22m(enabled/disabled, active/inactive/failed/...the other possible unit states...)

           •   status of tuned (enabled/disabled, active/inactive/failed/...the other possible unit states..., profile)

           •   the overall systemd 'system' status, read from [4m'systemctl[24m [4mis-system-running'[24m (running, degraded, ....)

